# Shell scripts and Dockerfiles must be LF in the working tree: CRLF breaks the
# shebang inside Linux images (entrypoint.sh, prisma/migrate.sh) and the
# heredoc-generated entrypoint, with "exec ... No such file or directory".
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.Dockerfile text eol=lf
